God's Eye View — vendored fork
==============================

This directory (`gev/`) is a vendored copy of

    https://github.com/MridhulSharma/gods-eye-view

which is a fork of

    https://github.com/bilawalsidhu/gods-eye-view

by Bilawal Sidhu, distributed under the MIT License.

The upstream license text is unchanged in `gev/LICENSE` and applies to all
files in this directory. Third-party dependency notices remain in
`gev/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`; bundled dataset provenance remains under
`gev/src/data/local_data/`.

Heads Up adds a `headsup` layer and its supporting modules inside this
directory. Those additions are part of the Heads Up research prototype and are
not endorsed by, or affiliated with, the upstream project or its author.
